@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #E3F2FD
  ParticipantBorderColor #1976D2
  ActorBackgroundColor #FFE0B2
  ActorBorderColor #FF9800
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
  LifeLineBorderColor #666666
  ArrowColor #1565C0
  SequenceMessageAlignment center
  SequenceArrowThickness 2
  SequenceMessageColor #333333
  SequenceActorFontColor #333333
  SequenceLifeLineFontColor #333333
  TitleBackgroundColor #007ACC
  TitleBorderColor #007ACC
  TitleFontColor #FFFFFF
}

title "分布式性能测试执行完整序列图"

actor "用户" as User
participant "CLI\nrun_platform.py" as CLI
participant "配置管理器\nConfigManager" as Config
participant "产品管理器\nProductManager" as PM
participant "分布式管理器\nDistributedManager" as DM
participant "SSH Worker管理器\nSSHWorkerManager" as SSH
participant "Locust Master" as Master
participant "Worker节点\nLocust Worker" as Worker
participant "目标API服务器\nTarget API" as API
participant "报告生成器\nReportGenerator" as Report
participant "场景管理器\nScenarioManager" as Scenario

User -> CLI: python run_platform.py --mode master --product example_product
activate CLI #FFE0B2

CLI -> CLI: 参数解析和环境验证
CLI -> Config: 加载配置文件
activate Config #E8F5E8

Config --> CLI: 返回配置对象
CLI -> PM: 验证产品存在性
activate PM #E8F5E8

PM --> CLI: 产品验证通过
CLI -> Scenario: 设置当前场景
activate Scenario #E8F5E8

Scenario --> CLI: 场景设置完成

CLI -> CLI: 检查分布式环境
CLI -> DM: validate_distributed_config()
activate DM #E3F2FD

DM -> SSH: initialize_workers(worker_configs)
activate SSH #E3F2FD

SSH -> SSH: 建立SSH连接池
SSH --> DM: Worker初始化完成

DM -> SSH: setup_ssh_trust()
SSH -> Worker: 配置SSH互信
Worker --> SSH: SSH互信配置成功
SSH --> DM: SSH互信建立完成

DM -> SSH: check_locust_environment()
SSH -> Worker: 检查Locust环境
Worker --> SSH: 环境检查通过
SSH --> DM: 环境验证通过

DM --> CLI: 分布式环境验证通过

CLI -> DM: start_distributed_master()
DM -> Master: 启动Locust Master进程
activate Master #FFCDD2

Master --> DM: Master启动成功

DM -> SSH: start_locust_workers(master_host, master_port)
SSH -> Worker: 启动Locust Worker进程
activate Worker #C8E6C9

Worker -> Master: 注册Worker节点
Master --> Worker: 分配任务配置

Worker --> SSH: Worker启动成功
SSH --> DM: 所有Worker启动完成
DM --> CLI: 分布式集群启动成功

CLI -> CLI: 开始执行测试场景

loop 对于每个测试场景
  CLI -> Scenario: 获取下一个场景配置
  Scenario --> CLI: 返回场景信息
  
  CLI -> DM: 更新场景信息到所有Worker
  DM -> SSH: 同步场景配置
  SSH -> Worker: 更新场景配置
  Worker --> SSH: 配置更新完成
  SSH --> DM: 场景同步完成
  
  CLI -> Master: 通过API启动测试
  Master -> Worker: 分发测试任务
  
  par 并发执行
    Worker -> API: 发送API请求
    activate API #F5F5F5
    API --> Worker: 返回响应
    deactivate API
    
    Worker -> Worker: 收集性能指标
  end
  
  Worker -> Master: 上报统计数据
  Master -> Master: 聚合性能数据
end

CLI -> Master: 停止测试
Master -> Worker: 停止任务执行
Worker --> Master: 确认停止

CLI -> Report: 生成测试报告
activate Report #FFF9C4

Report -> Report: 处理性能数据
Report -> Report: 生成可视化图表
Report -> Report: 创建HTML报告
Report --> CLI: 报告生成完成

CLI -> User: 测试完成，报告已生成
deactivate CLI

note right of User
  用户通过CLI启动测试流程
  自动完成分布式环境
  搭建和测试执行
end note

note left of Master
  Locust Master负责：
  • 任务调度分配
  • 数据聚合统计
  • Web界面服务
end note

note right of Worker
  Worker节点职责：
  • 执行API请求
  • 收集性能指标
  • 实时数据上报
end note

@enduml